<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-091-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.427418" lon="-120.970884"><name>SC26-091-B</name><cmt>SC26-091</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 7.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 65/100; not catch probability. Center 117 ft; nearby 110–133 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-071</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.43054257151561" lon="-120.97174133079105"/><trkpt lat="35.42954949675468" lon="-120.97165609753911"/><trkpt lat="35.42955689619442" lon="-120.97209648414872"/><trkpt lat="35.42919645071291" lon="-120.972105523609"/><trkpt lat="35.42917979993731" lon="-120.97111465837251"/><trkpt lat="35.42890946597605" lon="-120.97112144116943"/><trkpt lat="35.428758838600515" lon="-120.97288749194517"/><trkpt lat="35.42830828146446" lon="-120.97289878650727"/><trkpt lat="35.42822186756324" lon="-120.97312123522052"/><trkpt lat="35.426241263905766" lon="-120.97328101494286"/><trkpt lat="35.42631288601256" lon="-120.97217783351391"/><trkpt lat="35.425672857799164" lon="-120.97164319303167"/><trkpt lat="35.425667307655324" lon="-120.97131291900907"/><trkpt lat="35.42548708488881" lon="-120.97131743985611"/><trkpt lat="35.42548